Re: Help?


06 Dec 2020 21:19






While readers aren't obligated to give critique (authors are expected to get feedback BEFORE posting), I can list down a couple things that could be improved:

- Don't call it  is enough. Old articles may have done it, but it's unnecessary.

- The box should have three dimensions; 30 x 30cm would refer a flat area of that size. Also, why those exact dimensions? Do they have to be exactly that, and if so, why?

- Break down your paragraphs into more and smaller ones. Making the whole Description one big paragraph makes it a pain to read through.

- The SCP itself feels very much like a thing that makes people insane/kills people. That alone isn't so interesting.







